  ],
  "limits": [
    "Long straight edges constrain displacement normal to the line; tangential/horizontal displacement has an aperture ambiguity.",
    "Fixed-x blocks identify portions of the same geometric line, not independent persistent3D material points along it.",
    "The measured edge includes a photometric transition on the structural ridge; lighting and shadow changes can shift its apparent position.",
    "Search is limited to plus/minus12px and does not switch to a different edge if the selected one is lost.",
    "All341 images remain exposed development data. No real robot-feedback sequence is being measured."
  ]
